RegisterPropertyTest
├── when the caller lacks PROPERTY_ISSUER_ROLE
│   └── it should revert with AccessControlUnauthorizedAccount
├── when the contract is paused
│   └── it should revert with EnforcedPause
└── when the caller has PROPERTY_ISSUER_ROLE and contract is not paused
    ├── when the token address is zero
    │   └── it should revert with InvalidToken
    ├── when the token already has a registered property
    │   └── it should revert with PropertyAlreadyExists
    ├── when the property name is empty
    │   └── it should revert with InvalidName
    ├── when the location is empty
    │   └── it should revert with InvalidLocation
    ├── when the total area is zero
    │   └── it should revert with InvalidArea
    ├── when the units count is zero
    │   └── it should revert with InvalidUnits
    ├── when the construction start is zero
    │   └── it should revert with InvalidDates
    ├── when the estimated completion is zero
    │   └── it should revert with InvalidDates
    ├── when the estimated completion is before or equal to construction start
    │   └── it should revert with InvalidDates
    ├── when the cadastral number is empty
    │   └── it should revert with InvalidCadastralNumber
    ├── when the cadastral number is already used
    │   └── it should revert with CadastralNumberAlreadyUsed
    ├── when the total token supply is zero
    │   └── it should revert with InvalidTokenSupply
    ├── when the total investment target is zero
    │   └── it should revert with InvalidInvestmentTarget
    ├── when the estimated sale price is zero
    │   └── it should revert with InvalidSalePrice
    ├── when the estimated sale price is less than or equal to investment target
    │   └── it should revert with InvalidSalePrice
    └── when all parameters are valid
        ├── it should store the property with correct data
        ├── it should mark the property as existing
        ├── it should increment the property count
        ├── it should add the token to issuer's properties
        ├── it should map cadastral number to token
        ├── it should emit PropertyRegistered event
        └── it should emit FinancialDataUpdated event

